{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# 第一章 行列式","x":1190,"y":950,"width":400,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000012","type":"text","text":"**1.3 行列式的性质**\n\n化简时必须记清哪些量改变","x":650,"y":2013,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000020","type":"text","text":"**1.4 按行（列）展开**\n\n用低阶行列式计算高阶行列式","x":1790,"y":-218,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000032","type":"text","text":"**1.6 计算方法小结**\n\n先识别结构，再选择算法","x":1790,"y":2180,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000002","type":"text","text":"**1.1 数域与排列**\n\n定义符号与正负号的基础","x":650,"y":-641,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0000000000000018","type":"text","text":"**倍乘性**\n\n某一行 / 列全体乘 $k$，则行列式乘 $k$；公因子可提出。\n零行 / 零列 $\\Rightarrow D=0$。","x":-10,"y":1861,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000001a","type":"text","text":"**相同行 / 成比例行**\n\n两行（或两列）对应元素相同或成比例，\n则 $D=0$。","x":-10,"y":2175,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000000a","type":"text","text":"**方程组背景**\n\n研究 $n$ 个未知量、$n$ 个线性方程组成的方程组。\n系数行列式 $D$ 是判断能否用公式求唯一解的关键。","x":-10,"y":-64,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"000000000000000e","type":"text","text":"**$n$ 阶行列式**\n\n每项从不同行、不同列各取一个元素，共 $n!$ 项；列指标为偶排列取正、奇排列取负。\n$D=\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\operatorname{sgn}(\\sigma)\\prod_i a_{i,\\sigma(i)}$。","x":-10,"y":564,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"000000000000000c","type":"text","text":"**低阶**","x":-10,"y":270,"width":480,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0000000000000010","type":"text","text":"**值与阶数**\n\n元素 $a_{ij}$：$i$ 为行指标，$j$ 为列指标；一阶行列式 $|a|=a$。\n元素全为常数时 $D$ 为数；含变量时 $D$ 为多项式。","x":-10,"y":873,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0000000000000006","type":"text","text":"**排列与奇偶**\n\n$n$ 阶排列共 $n!$ 个；逆序数 $\\tau$ 的奇偶决定排列奇偶。\n一次对换必改变奇偶；$n\\ge2$ 时奇、偶排列各占一半（$n=1$ 例外）。","x":-10,"y":-489,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0000000000000004","type":"text","text":"**数域**\n\n至少含两个复数，并对加、减、乘、除（除数非 $0$）封闭。\n任意数域都含 $\\mathbb{Q}$；$\\mathbb{Q}\\subset\\mathbb{R}\\subset\\mathbb{C}$。","x":-10,"y":-838,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0000000000000022","type":"text","text":"**余子式**\n\n划去 $a_{ij}$ 所在第 $i$ 行、第 $j$ 列得 $M_{ij}$。\n$A_{ij}=(-1)^{i+j}M_{ij}$；符号按棋盘格交替。","x":2290,"y":-831,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000024","type":"text","text":"**拉普拉斯按行 / 列展开**\n\n任取第 $i$ 行：$D=\\sum_j a_{ij}A_{ij}$；\n任取第 $j$ 列：$D=\\sum_i a_{ij}A_{ij}$。","x":2290,"y":-482,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000026","type":"text","text":"**代数余子式正交性**\n\n另一行（列）的元素与本行（列）代数余子式对应相乘求和为 $0$。\n同一行（列）对应求和为 $D$。","x":2290,"y":-183,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000028","type":"text","text":"**Laplace拉普拉斯定理**\n\n固定 $k$ 行（列），$D$ 可写成所有 $k$ 阶子式与对应代数余子式乘积之和。\n可按结构稀疏的行 / 列分组降阶。","x":2290,"y":126,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"000000000000002a","type":"text","text":"**降阶**\n\n**展开策略**\n先用性质把某行 / 列化出尽可能多的 $0$，\n再沿该行 / 列展开，递归降到二、三阶。","x":2290,"y":420,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"000000000000002e","type":"text","text":"**Cramer**\n\n若系数行列式 $D\\ne0$，方程组有唯一解：\n$x_j=\\dfrac{D_j}{D}$；$D_j$ 将 $D$ 的第 $j$ 列替换为常数列。","x":2290,"y":825,"width":480,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000030","type":"text","text":"**齐次方程组**\n\n若系数行列式 $D\\ne0$，齐次方程组只有零解。\n（$D=0$ 时不能套用克拉默公式。）","x":2290,"y":1164,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000034","type":"text","text":"**可直接求值的典型结构**\n\n上 / 下三角：主对角线元素之积。\n反三角：$(-1)^{n(n-1)/2}$ 乘副对角线元素之积；分块三角：对角块行列式之积。","x":2290,"y":1624,"width":480,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000038","type":"text","text":"**化三角**\n\n常用倍加把行列式化为三角形，再取主对角线之积。\n交换要变号；倍乘要提出因子；倍加不改变值。","x":2290,"y":2437,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"000000000000003a","type":"text","text":"**递推**\n\n利用展开或变换建立 $D_n$ 与低阶行列式的关系，\n反复递推至已知初值。","x":2290,"y":2756,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000036","type":"text","text":"**范德蒙德**\n\n**范德蒙德行列式**\n$D(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)=\\displaystyle\\prod_{i<j}(a_j-a_i)$。","x":2290,"y":2068,"width":480,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000016","type":"text","text":"**交换两行 / 列**\n\n行列式只改变符号：$D\\mapsto-D$。\n交换两次则符号恢复。","x":-10,"y":1542,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000014","type":"text","text":"**转置**\n\n$D=D^{\\mathsf T}$。\n行与列地位平等；关于行成立的性质也对应适用于列。","x":-10,"y":1238,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000001c","type":"text","text":"**分行 / 列相加性**\n\n某一行（列）是两组元素之和时，\n行列式可按该行（列）拆成两个行列式之和。","x":-10,"y":2484,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000001e","type":"text","text":"**倍加性**\n\n把另一行（列）的 $k$ 倍加到某行（列），值不变：\n$R_i\\leftarrow R_i+kR_j$（$i\\ne j$）。","x":-10,"y":2773,"width":480,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000002c","type":"text","text":"**1.5 克拉默法则**\n\n行列式与方程组解的联系","x":1790,"y":1002,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000008","type":"text","text":"**1.2 行列式的定义**\n\n从低阶公式推广到 $n$ 阶","x":650,"y":412,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0000000000000100","type":"text","text":"**数域：封闭性与判断**\n\n$P\\subseteq\\mathbb C$；至少含两个**不同**元素。\n由 $a\\ne0$ 得 $0=a-a$、$1=a/a$，故 $\\mathbb Q\\subseteq P$。\n\n已证加、减、乘封闭后，只需再证每个非零元素的倒数仍在 $P$ 中。\n- $\\mathbb Z$ 不是数域：$2\\in\\mathbb Z$，但 $1/2\\notin\\mathbb Z$。\n- $\\mathbb Q(\\sqrt2)=\\{a+b\\sqrt2:a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\}$ 是数域。\n- $K\\subseteq F$ 时，$K$ 为子域，$F$ 为扩域。","x":-1010,"y":-908,"width":820,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0000000000000102","type":"text","text":"**逆序数、对换与通项符号**\n\n$$\\tau(i_1\\cdots i_n)=\\sum_{p<q}\\mathbf1_{\\{i_p>i_q\\}}$$\n反序后：$\\tau(i_n\\cdots i_1)=n(n-1)/2-\\tau(i_1\\cdots i_n)$。\n相隔 $s$ 个位置的对换可拆成 $2s+1$ 次相邻对换，故必改变奇偶。\n\n一般通项 $a_{i_1j_1}\\cdots a_{i_nj_n}$ 的符号为\n$$(-1)^{\\tau(i_1\\cdots i_n)+\\tau(j_1\\cdots j_n)}.$$\n行指标已按标准排列时，只看列指标的逆序数。","x":-1010,"y":-564,"width":820,"height":310,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0000000000000104","type":"text","text":"**线性方程组的形式**\n\n$$\\begin{cases}\na_{11}x_1+\\cdots+a_{1n}x_n=b_1\\\\\n\\vdots\\\\\na_{n1}x_1+\\cdots+a_{nn}x_n=b_n\n\\end{cases}$$\n一组有序的数同时满足每个方程，才是方程组的解。\n$D=\\det(a_{ij})$ 是系数行列式，不含常数列 $b$。","x":-1010,"y":-104,"width":820,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0000000000000106","type":"text","text":"**二阶与三阶公式**\n\n$$\\begin{vmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&c\\\\d&e&f\\\\g&h&i\\end{vmatrix}\n={}&aei+bfg+cdh\\\\&-afh-bdi-ceg.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n三阶对角线法则仅是低阶记忆法，**不能直接推广到四阶及以上**。","x":-1010,"y":180,"width":820,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"0000000000000108","type":"text","text":"**通项的选取与正负号**\n\n$$D=\\sum_{j_1\\cdots j_n}(-1)^{\\tau(j_1\\cdots j_n)}a_{1j_1}\\cdots a_{nj_n}$$\n求和遍历 $1,\\ldots,n$ 的全部排列。每项取 $n$ 个元素，**行不重复、列也不重复**。\n$n!$ 是定义展开的项数；其中有的项可能为零。\n\n例如 $a_{12}a_{23}a_{31}$：列排列为 $231$，逆序数为 $2$，取正。\n$a_{13}a_{22}a_{31}$：列排列为 $321$，逆序数为 $3$，取负。","x":-1010,"y":514,"width":820,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"000000000000010a","type":"text","text":"**行列式的阶数不是多项式次数**\n\n$n$ 阶指 $n$ 行 $n$ 列；$|a|=a$，不是绝对值。\n元素属于数域 $P$ 时，$D$ 也属于 $P$。\n\n若每个元素都是变量 $x$ 的一次以下多项式，则 $\\deg D\\le n$，也可能降次或恒为零。\n例如 $\\det(a_{ij}+x)$ 中，两列同时取 $x\\mathbf1$ 会成比例，所以次数**至多为 $1$**。","x":-1010,"y":838,"width":820,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"000000000000010c","type":"text","text":"**转置的具体形式**\n\n$$\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&c\\\\d&e&f\\\\g&h&i\\end{vmatrix}\n=\\begin{vmatrix}a&d&g\\\\b&e&h\\\\c&f&i\\end{vmatrix}$$\n转置只把行列互换，**不改变值、不改变符号**。\n可以转置后按更方便的行或列运算；转置型范德蒙德仍用同一乘积公式。","x":-1010,"y":1198,"width":820,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"000000000000010e","type":"text","text":"**置换与反序的符号**\n\n交换两行（列）一次，$D'=-D$；交换 $m$ 次，$D'=(-1)^mD$。\n同时交换两行、再交换两列，两个负号抵消。\n\n把全部列反序需 $n(n-1)/2$ 次相邻对换：\n$$D'=(-1)^{n(n-1)/2}D.$$\n反三角与反序范德蒙德的符号都由此产生。","x":-1010,"y":1482,"width":820,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000110","type":"text","text":"**提出公因子：一行与整表的区别**\n\n某行 $R_i=k\\widetilde R_i$，则 $D=k\\widetilde D$。\n各行分别有公因子 $k_1,\\ldots,k_n$，可提出 $\\prod_i k_i$。\n\n把**全部 $n^2$ 个元素**都乘 $k$，等于每行都乘 $k$：\n$$\\det(kA)=k^n\\det A.$$\n不是只乘一个 $k$。有一行或一列全零，则 $D=0$。","x":-1010,"y":1806,"width":820,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000112","type":"text","text":"**判零：先造出相同或成比例的行列**\n\n$R_i=kR_j$（$i\\ne j$）$\\Rightarrow D=0$；零行也包含在内。\n\n若 $n\\ge3$，$a_{ij}=u_i+v_j$，则\n$C_j-C_1=(v_j-v_1)\\mathbf1$；后面的列成比例，故 $D=0$。\n若 $a_{ij}=x_iy_j$、$n>1$，各列都是同一列向量的倍数，也有 $D=0$。\n\n**不能倒推**：$D=0$ 不一定意味着原表中已有两行成比例。","x":-1010,"y":2120,"width":820,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000114","type":"text","text":"**拆分只对一行或一列使用线性性**\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}u_1+v_1&u_2+v_2\\\\p&q\\end{vmatrix}\n={}&\\begin{vmatrix}u_1&u_2\\\\p&q\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&+\\begin{vmatrix}v_1&v_2\\\\p&q\\end{vmatrix}.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n其余行列必须保持原样。不能据此写成 $\\det(A+B)=\\det A+\\det B$。\n多行拆分时，要保留所有组合项，再用相同列、成比例列删掉零项。","x":-1010,"y":2434,"width":820,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000116","type":"text","text":"**倍加操作与先后顺序**\n\n$R_i\\leftarrow R_i+kR_j$、$C_i\\leftarrow C_i+kC_j$，要求 $i\\ne j$。\n加减任意倍数都不改变行列式；但被加的行列须用**当前值**。\n\n相邻作差 $R_i\\leftarrow R_i-R_{i-1}$，若要引用变换前的上一行，须**从下向上**做。\n累加 $R_i\\leftarrow R_i+R_{i-1}$，若要引用已变换的上一行，须**从上向下**做。","x":-1010,"y":2738,"width":820,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"0000000000000118","type":"text","text":"**余子式：保序删行列，再乘符号**\n\n四阶中删去第 $3$ 行、第 $2$ 列：\n$$M_{32}=\\begin{vmatrix}\na_{11}&a_{13}&a_{14}\\\\a_{21}&a_{23}&a_{24}\\\\a_{41}&a_{43}&a_{44}\n\\end{vmatrix},\\qquad A_{32}=-M_{32}.$$\n符号表：$\\begin{pmatrix}+&-&+&\\cdots\\\\-&+&-&\\cdots\\\\+&-&+&\\cdots\\\\\\vdots&\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots\\end{pmatrix}$。\n$M_{ij}$、$A_{ij}$ 都不含第 $i$ 行、第 $j$ 列的元素。","x":2950,"y":-926,"width":940,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"000000000000011a","type":"text","text":"**按行展开的三阶示范**\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{vmatrix}a&b&c\\\\d&e&f\\\\g&h&i\\end{vmatrix}\n={}&a\\begin{vmatrix}e&f\\\\h&i\\end{vmatrix}\\\\\n&-b\\begin{vmatrix}d&f\\\\g&i\\end{vmatrix}\n+c\\begin{vmatrix}d&e\\\\g&h\\end{vmatrix}.\n\\end{aligned}$$\n展开只固定**一行或一列**。若用 $M_{ij}$，另乘 $(-1)^{i+j}$；若用 $A_{ij}$，不再重复乘符号。","x":2950,"y":-532,"width":940,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"000000000000011c","type":"text","text":"**同排得 $D$，异排得 $0$；余子式求和法**\n\n$$\\sum_{j=1}^n a_{kj}A_{ij}=\\begin{cases}D,&k=i\\\\0,&k\\ne i\\end{cases}$$\n列式对应为 $\\sum_{i=1}^n a_{ik}A_{ij}=D$（$k=j$）或 $0$（$k\\ne j$）。\n\n求 $\\sum_j\\lambda_jA_{ij}$：把第 $i$ 行替换成 $(\\lambda_1,\\ldots,\\lambda_n)$，再按该行展开。\n因为这些 $A_{ij}$ 不含第 $i$ 行元素，替换后它们不变；求 $\\sum_jA_{ij}$ 就替换成全 $1$ 行。","x":2950,"y":-228,"width":940,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"000000000000011e","type":"text","text":"**$k$ 阶子式与 Laplace 展开的完整符号**\n\n固定行指标 $I=\\{i_1<\\cdots<i_k\\}$；遍历所有 $J=\\{j_1<\\cdots<j_k\\}$。\n$N_J=\\det A[I,J]$；删去这些行列，余子式为 $\\det A[I^c,J^c]$。\n\n$$D=\\sum_{|J|=k}(-1)^{\\sum I+\\sum J}\\det A[I,J]\\det A[I^c,J^c].$$\n共 $\\binom nk$ 项，取 $1\\le k<n$。各子式内保留原相对顺序，不能任意重排而不计变号。","x":2950,"y":86,"width":940,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000120","type":"text","text":"**制造零后展开：单非零元的情形**\n\n若第 $i$ 行只有 $a_{ij}$ 可能非零，直接有\n$$D=a_{ij}A_{ij}=(-1)^{i+j}a_{ij}M_{ij}.$$\n优先选零最多的行列；若都不稀疏，先倍加制造零。\n多行集中在少数列时，考虑 Laplace 分组展开，不必逐个元素硬算。","x":2950,"y":390,"width":940,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0000000000000122","type":"text","text":"**克拉默公式：替换列，不是行**\n\n$$A\\mathbf x=\\mathbf b,\\quad D=\\det A\\ne0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_j=\\frac{D_j}{D}.$$\n$D_j$ 只把第 $j$ 列改成 $\\mathbf b$；其他列、列次序不动。\n二元式：\n$$x_1=\\frac{b_1a_{22}-a_{12}b_2}{D},\\qquad x_2=\\frac{a_{11}b_2-b_1a_{21}}{D}.$$\n$D=0$ 只是公式失效，**不能据此断言无解**；可能无解，也可能有无穷多解。","x":2950,"y":760,"width":940,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000124","type":"text","text":"**齐次方程组：零解与参数判定**\n\n右端全零时，各 $D_j=0$；若 $D\\ne0$，唯一解为 $x_j=0$。\n方阵情形也有：$D=0\\iff$ 存在非零解（消元观点见第二章）。\n\n例 1.5.3 的系数行列式为\n$$D=-(\\lambda-1)^2(\\lambda+2).$$\n所以 $\\lambda\\notin\\{1,-2\\}$ 时只有零解；在这两个值处有非零解。","x":2950,"y":1104,"width":940,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"0000000000000126","type":"text","text":"**三角、反三角与分块的形式**\n\n$$\\begin{vmatrix}d_1&*&*\\\\0&d_2&*\\\\0&0&d_3\\end{vmatrix}=d_1d_2d_3$$\n反三角（副对角线一侧全零）：\n$$D=(-1)^{n(n-1)/2}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,n+1-i}.$$\n分块三角：$\\begin{vmatrix}A&0\\\\C&B\\end{vmatrix}=\\begin{vmatrix}A&C\\\\0&B\\end{vmatrix}=\\det A\\det B$。\n分块反三角：$\\begin{vmatrix}0&A\\\\B&C\\end{vmatrix}=(-1)^{rs}\\det A\\det B$。\n$A,B$ 分别为 $r,s$ 阶方阵；零块尺寸要匹配，$C$ 任意，无须可逆。","x":2950,"y":1514,"width":940,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000128","type":"text","text":"**范德蒙德的形式、条件与符号**\n\n$$D(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)=\\begin{vmatrix}\n1&1&\\cdots&1\\\\\na_1&a_2&\\cdots&a_n\\\\\na_1^2&a_2^2&\\cdots&a_n^2\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&&\\vdots\\\\\na_1^{n-1}&a_2^{n-1}&\\cdots&a_n^{n-1}\n\\end{vmatrix}=\\prod_{1\\le i<j\\le n}(a_j-a_i).$$\n每列对应一个 $a_j$，幂次从 $0$ 到 $n-1$。\n- $D\\ne0\\iff a_1,\\ldots,a_n$ 两两不同；出现重复参数则 $D=0$。\n- 转置不变号；交换两列要变号；幂次倒序乘 $(-1)^{n(n-1)/2}$。\n- 幂次从 $1$ 到 $n$，先提出 $\\prod_j a_j$，再套标准式。\n递推：$D_n=D_{n-1}\\prod_{i=1}^{n-1}(a_n-a_i)$，$D_1=1$。","x":2950,"y":1958,"width":940,"height":370,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"000000000000012a","type":"text","text":"**化三角：符号、因子与零主元**\n\n若变换共交换 $s$ 次，把各行倍乘 $k_1,\\ldots,k_t\\ne0$，最终三角行列式为 $T$，则\n$$D=\\frac{(-1)^s}{k_1\\cdots k_t}T.$$\n只用倍加且不交换时，原值等于变换后对角线元素之积。\n遇零主元先换行寻找非零元；**不要除以零**。若用含参数的元素作除数，必须另讨论它为零的情况。","x":2950,"y":2392,"width":940,"height":230,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"000000000000012c","type":"text","text":"**递推：形式相同的低阶式，加上初值**\n\n例 1.4.2：主对角线 $x$、上邻对角线 $-1$，末行为 $(a_n,a_{n-1},\\ldots,a_2,x+a_1)$。\n$$D_n=xD_{n-1}+a_n,\\qquad D_1=x+a_1.$$\n因此\n$$D_n=x^n+a_1x^{n-1}+\\cdots+a_n.$$\n使用 $D_{n-1}$ 前确认删行列后的参数顺序与定义一致；二阶递推需要两个初值。\n三对角、循环、拆分等典型结构见右侧专题卡片。","x":2950,"y":2686,"width":940,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000138","type":"text","text":"**特殊行列式速查**\n\n形式 · 条件 · 结果 · 识别方法\n\n角型与爪形是不同结构，分别列出。","x":4090,"y":945,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"000000000000012e","type":"text","text":"**角型：主对角线外只有两个角元**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\na_1&0&\\cdots&0&p\\\\\n0&a_2&\\cdots&0&0\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots&\\vdots\\\\\n0&0&\\cdots&a_{n-1}&0\\\\\nq&0&\\cdots&0&a_n\n\\end{vmatrix}=(a_1a_n-pq)\\prod_{i=2}^{n-1}a_i.$$\n$n\\ge2$，$n=2$ 时中间的空乘积为 $1$。无须任何 $a_i$ 非零。\n展开中只有“全取主对角线”与“取两个角元再取中间对角线”可能非零；后一项相当于对换 $1,n$，取负。\n习题中的 $p=q=1$：结果为 $(a_1a_n-1)\\prod_{i=2}^{n-1}a_i$。","x":4650,"y":-1048,"width":1020,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"000000000000012f","type":"text","text":"**爪形（箭形）：首行、首列加主对角线**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\na_1&b_2&b_3&\\cdots&b_n\\\\\nc_2&a_2&0&\\cdots&0\\\\\nc_3&0&a_3&\\cdots&0\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\nc_n&0&0&\\cdots&a_n\n\\end{vmatrix}.$$\n若 $a_2,\\ldots,a_n\\ne0$，用 $R_1\\leftarrow R_1-\\sum_{i=2}^n(b_i/a_i)R_i$ 消去首行侧枝：\n$$D_n=\\left(\\prod_{i=2}^na_i\\right)\\left(a_1-\\sum_{i=2}^n\\frac{b_ic_i}{a_i}\\right).$$\n不含除法、也适用于某些 $a_i=0$ 的形式：\n$$D_n=a_1\\prod_{i=2}^na_i-\\sum_{i=2}^nb_ic_i\\prod_{\\substack{2\\le j\\le n\\\\j\\ne i}}a_j.$$","x":4650,"y":-684,"width":1020,"height":430,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000130","type":"text","text":"**主对角线同为 $a$，其他元素同为 $b$**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\na&b&\\cdots&b\\\\b&a&\\cdots&b\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\b&b&\\cdots&a\n\\end{vmatrix}=[a+(n-1)b](a-b)^{n-1}.$$\n做 $C_1\\leftarrow C_1+\\cdots+C_n$，首列全为 $a+(n-1)b$；再作 $R_i\\leftarrow R_i-R_1$（$i\\ge2$），直接化为上三角，无须除以参数。\n\n若 $a$ 改放在**副对角线**、其余为 $b$，再乘 $(-1)^{n(n-1)/2}$。\n例如五阶对角线为 $7$、其他为 $2$，值为 $[7+4\\cdot2](7-2)^4$。","x":4650,"y":-190,"width":1020,"height":290,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000131","type":"text","text":"**各列固定，主对角线减去 $a_i$**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\nx_1-a_1&x_2&\\cdots&x_n\\\\\nx_1&x_2-a_2&\\cdots&x_n\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\nx_1&x_2&\\cdots&x_n-a_n\n\\end{vmatrix}.$$\n若全部 $a_i\\ne0$：\n$$D_n=(-1)^n\\left(\\prod_{i=1}^na_i\\right)\\left(1-\\sum_{i=1}^n\\frac{x_i}{a_i}\\right).$$\n任意 $a_i$ 均可用的无除法形式：\n$$D_n=(-1)^n\\left(\\prod_{i=1}^na_i-\\sum_{i=1}^nx_i\\prod_{j\\ne i}a_j\\right).$$\n按列拆成“固定向量 $x_i\\mathbf1$”与“单点对角列”；选两列固定向量就成比例，只剩零列或一列固定向量的贡献。","x":4650,"y":164,"width":1020,"height":440,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000132","type":"text","text":"**单位阵加同向列：$I+uv^{\\mathsf T}$**\n\n$$\\det(I_n+uv^{\\mathsf T})=1+\\sum_{i=1}^nu_iv_i.$$\n这是普通转置，不是复共轭转置。按列拆分：全取单位列得 $1$；只取第 $i$ 个同向列得 $u_iv_i$；取两列以上则成比例，贡献 $0$。\n\n习题课的 $u=v=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)^{\\mathsf T}$：\n$$\\begin{vmatrix}\n1+a_1^2&a_1a_2&\\cdots&a_1a_n\\\\\na_2a_1&1+a_2^2&\\cdots&a_2a_n\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\na_na_1&a_na_2&\\cdots&1+a_n^2\n\\end{vmatrix}=1+\\sum_i a_i^2.$$\n对应变式：对角线 $1+a_i$、非对角线全为 $1$，若 $a_i\\ne0$，值为 $\\prod_i a_i(1+\\sum_i1/a_i)$。","x":4650,"y":668,"width":1020,"height":370,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000133","type":"text","text":"**三对角：只保留主对角线及其两侧**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\na_1&b_1&0&\\cdots&0\\\\\nc_1&a_2&b_2&\\cdots&0\\\\\n0&c_2&a_3&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\ddots&b_{n-1}\\\\\n0&0&\\cdots&c_{n-1}&a_n\n\\end{vmatrix}.$$\n$D_k$ 指原表**左上角 $k$ 阶主子式**；按末行展开：\n$$D_n=a_nD_{n-1}-b_{n-1}c_{n-1}D_{n-2}\\quad(n\\ge2).$$\n初值：$D_0=1$，$D_1=a_1$，故 $D_2=a_1a_2-b_1c_1$。\n负号来自末行的次对角元，不能写成加号；不要求 $b_ic_i\\ne0$。","x":4650,"y":1102,"width":1020,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000134","type":"text","text":"**常系数三对角：递推的显式结果**\n\n主对角线全为 $a$，上邻对角线为 $b$，下邻对角线为 $c$，其余全零。\n$$D_n=aD_{n-1}-bcD_{n-2},\\qquad D_0=1,\\quad D_1=a.$$\n无须除法的通式：\n$$D_n=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor}(-bc)^k\\binom{n-k}{k}a^{n-2k}.$$\n令 $r_\\pm=(a\\pm\\sqrt{a^2-4bc})/2$，则\n$$D_n=\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{r_+^{n+1}-r_-^{n+1}}{r_+-r_-},&r_+\\ne r_-\\\\\n(n+1)r^n,&r_+=r_-=r.\n\\end{cases}$$\n典型代入：$a=2\\cos\\theta$、$b=c=1$，$\\sin\\theta\\ne0$ 时，$D_n=\\sin((n+1)\\theta)/\\sin\\theta$。","x":4650,"y":1526,"width":1020,"height":410,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000135","type":"text","text":"**双对角线：偶数阶主、副对角线**\n\n$$D_{2m}=\\begin{vmatrix}\na&0&\\cdots&0&b\\\\\n0&a&\\cdots&b&0\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots&\\vdots\\\\\n0&b&\\cdots&a&0\\\\\nb&0&\\cdots&0&a\n\\end{vmatrix}_{2m}=(a^2-b^2)^m.$$\n同时把行与列按 $(1,2m,2,2m-1,\\ldots,m,m+1)$ 重排，得到 $m$ 个 $\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\b&a\\end{pmatrix}$ 对角块。\n两次相同置换的符号抵消；也可用 $D_{2m}=(a^2-b^2)D_{2m-2}$、$D_0=1$ 递推。\n此处限定**偶数阶**，不会出现主、副对角线在中心重合的问题。","x":4650,"y":2000,"width":1020,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000136","type":"text","text":"**循环双带：主对角线与首尾相接的上邻对角线**\n\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\nx&y&0&\\cdots&0\\\\\n0&x&y&\\cdots&0\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n0&0&\\cdots&x&y\\\\\ny&0&\\cdots&0&x\n\\end{vmatrix}=x^n+(-1)^{n-1}y^n\\quad(n\\ge2).$$\n定义展开只有两个排列能给出非零项：标准排列与循环排列 $23\\cdots n1$。\n循环排列逆序数为 $n-1$，所以 $y^n$ 前的符号随阶数奇偶变化。","x":4650,"y":2384,"width":1020,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0000000000000137","type":"text","text":"**各行和相同：先把列相加，再看循环结构**\n\n若每行元素和都为 $s$，做 $C_1\\leftarrow C_1+\\cdots+C_n$，首列全为 $s$。可提出 $s$，再倍加消元；$s=0$ 时直接判零。\n**行和相同不意味着只靠 $s$ 就能求出整个行列式。**\n\n本章的循环例：\n$$D_n=\\begin{vmatrix}\n1&2&\\cdots&n\\\\\nn&1&\\cdots&n-1\\\\\n\\vdots&\\vdots&\\ddots&\\vdots\\\\\n2&3&\\cdots&1\n\\end{vmatrix}=(-1)^{n-1}\\frac{n^{n-1}(n+1)}2.$$\n先作 $C_1\\leftarrow\\sum_jC_j$，再从下向上作 $R_i\\leftarrow R_i-R_{i-1}$；对 $j=2,\\ldots,n-1$ 作 $C_j\\leftarrow C_j-C_n$ 后，沿第 $1$ 列、再沿所得子式的首行展开，剩余为对角形，得到该结果。","x":4650,"y":2728,"width":1020,"height":360,"color":"6"}
	],
